  "body": "Vendor instructions are clear: Present all offers!\r\n\r\nAn overseas opportunity is locked in, and my vendor is NOT waiting around, their instructions could not be clearer: BRING ME AN OFFER!\r\n\r\nIf you’ve been looking for a sundrenched, high spec sanctuary in the heart of Mission Bay, this is your moment. Tucked into the quiet, garden side Mews section of The Outlook, this elevated one bedroom stunner is light, bright, and soaked in northern sun.\r\n\r\nIt comes fully loaded with all the extras, including a dedicated secure car park, private storage locker, and incredibly low body corporate fees. To top it off, you're in an unbeatable spot, directly across the road from Eastridge Shopping Centre and minutes from the sand and all The Bays lifestyle has to offer. \r\n\r\nThis is hands down the sharpest entry level buying opportunity in the Eastern Bays right now. Blink and you’ll miss it. Call immediately for a private viewing before someone else snaps it up!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
